155:{character:A-37} I really appreciate your help! Be careful on the way.
156:{character:A-37} That area... Isn't very safe. I'd suggest getting back here as soon as the delivery's been made, don't hang around.
157:{character:player} Block C... No. 2... This is the place!
158:{character:???} Who might you be?
