160:{character:???} I'm Saturne, but...
161:{character:player} I'm with Éternité, sir. I've come to deliver your order. We hope you enjoy it.
162:{character:Saturne} Ah... I seem to recall the delivery person for Éternité was a young lad, pretty tall and with a darker complexion. Did he not come to work today?
163:{character:player} We have a lot of orders today, so he's taking care of another area.
164:{character:Saturne} Haha, I see. No wonder Éternité has become a viral hit. Seems there are many others like me, who cannot resist your delicious offerings yet don't wish to stand in line in this heat.
165:{character:player} It's a great honor for us to be appreciated by everyone.
166:{character:Saturne} Haha! I believe having staff such as yourself is another secret of Éternité's success! May I, in turn, have the honor of inviting you to enjoy this refreshing beverage?
167:{character:player} Sir, I'm not sure...
168:{character:Saturne} My apologies. It was so delightful speaking with you that I forgot my manners. No offense meant. Nevertheless, if possible I would still like to share this with you.
169:{character:Saturne} I had originally invited another guest, you see, only to receive notice just now that he is unable to come. Alas, it would be a terrible shame if all the delicious nibbles and drinks go to waste.
170:{character:Saturne} Therefore, if there was even the teeniest possibility, it would be my pleasure to invite you to partake of this fare with me.
